{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, creatures seeking better forms evolved into crabs.<br>Your recommendations are personalized, your devices optimized, and anything unnecessary eliminated\u2014thus the world accelerates yet again today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Algorithm</strong> means \u201ca procedure for solving a problem\u201d or \u201can ordered sequence of steps.\u201d<br>Observe the people living in your assigned district, and make the best choices for everyone\u2019s happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice becomes the correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the truth of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a town where nostalgia and the future intersect, an incident unfolds.<br>A Grand Hotel\u2013style, sci-fi-flavored interactive fiction adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820410/extras/3393c7d746155afc130dd78dd761a981.avif?t=1765726068\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820410/extras_big/3393c7d746155afc130dd78dd761a981.webp?t=1765726068 width=1560 height=2228 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820410?t=1765726068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820410/e91b74fd1459b4c0f0f61d0d060b0134f3b65af3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765726068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820410/c996691ef87c904447af4bd2b8247708755d73e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765726068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820410/c996691ef87c904447af4bd2b8247708755d73e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765726068","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe